# Testnet only. Never put a key with real funds here.
#
# Nothing in this project signs or sends a transaction, so no private key is read or
# accepted. WALLET_ADDRESS is public and only names the account whose perp margin the
# pre-flight check reads; leave it blank to check a hypothetical account instead.
